        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_6",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_7",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_8"
      ],
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Sales Tax (Amendment) Bill 1999"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Sales Tax (Amendment) Act 1999."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act shall come into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette, and the Minister may appoint different dates for different provisions of this Act. Amendment of section 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Sales Tax Act 1972[Act 64], which in this Act is referred to as the \"principal Act\", is amended in section 2 by inserting after the definition of \"senior officer of sales tax\" the following definition: \"surcharge\" means any charge that is due and payable under section 30(1B);'. Amendment of section 5"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_3__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_3__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 5 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the marginal note, by inserting after the words \"Authority cards\" the words \", etc.\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (1), by substituting for the words \"document establishing his identity as the Director General or, in the Bill case of a police officer, the Inspector General of Police may direct to be carried by such officer\" the words \"badge or authority card as he has been directed to carry under section 9(1) of the Customs Act 1967\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_3__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (2), by substituting for the words \"identification document\" the words \"badge or authority card\". Amendment of section 7"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 7 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: \"(3) Where goods are manufactured on behalf of any supplier of taxable goods from taxable goods supplied by him and the goods so manufactured are returned to the supplier of the taxable goods, then the sale value of the goods so manufactured may, subject to approval of the Director General, be the amount that the manufacturer charges for work performed by him.\". New section 12A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_5",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_6",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_7",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_8",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_9"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 12 the following section: 12A. (1) Notwithstanding sections 12 and 13, where t h e D i r e c t or General is satisfied that any separation of business activities is artificial, he may make a direction under this section directing that the persons named in that direction shall be treated as a single taxable person carrying on the activities of the business described in that direction and that single taxable person shall not continue to carry on the activities of such business unless he is licensed within twenty-one days from the date the direction is served on the last of such persons or from such later date as may be specified in that direction. (2) For the purposes of subsection (1), in determining whether any separation of business activities is artificial, regard shall be had to the extent to which the different persons carrying on those business activities are closely bound to one another by financial, economic and organizational links."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_3__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_3__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Director General may make a direction under this section naming any person if the Director General is satisfied—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "that the person is manufacturing or has manufactured taxable goods;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "that the activities in the course of which the person manufactures or has manufactured those taxable goods form only part of certain activities in the business and that the other activities in that business (whether or not they are similar to the activities carried on by that person) are being carried on concurrently or previously, or both, by one or more other persons; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_3__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "that if all the taxable goods manufactured in that business were taken into account, the person carrying on that business would, at the time of such direction, be required to be licensed by virtue of section 13."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any direction made under this section shall be served on each of the persons named in it."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_5__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_5__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where, after a direction has been given under this section specifying a description of the business, it appears to the Director General that any person who has not been named in that direction is manufacturing taxable goods in the course of activities which should be regarded as part of the activities of the business, the Director General may make and serve on that person a supplementary direction referring to the earlier direction and the description of business specified in it, and adding that person's name to those of the persons named in the earlier direction with effect from—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_5__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the date on which that person began to manufacture the taxable goods; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_5__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "if the date of the earlier direction was later than the date mentioned in paragraph (a), the date with effect from which the single taxable person referred to in the earlier direction is licensed under subsection (1)."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_6",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_6__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_6__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where, immediately before any direction (including a supplementary direction) is made under this section, any person named in the direction is licensed in respect of taxable goods manufactured by him as mentioned in subsection (3) or (5), his licence shall be revoked by the Director General with effect from—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_6__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the date the single taxable person is licensed under subsection (1); or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_6__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "such later date as may be specified in that direction, and upon the revocation of his licence he together with all the persons named in the direction shall be treated as a single taxable person under this section."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_7",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In relation to a business specified in a direction under this section, the persons named in such direction together with any person named in a supplementary direction relating to that business (being the persons who together are to be treated as a single taxable person) are in subsections (8) and (9) referred to as \"the constituent members\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_8",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_8__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_8__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_8__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_8__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_8__para_e"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where any direction is made under this section, then for the purposes of this Act—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_8__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the single taxable person carrying on the business specified in the direction shall be licensed in such name as the persons named in the direction may jointly nominate by notice in writing given to the Director General not later than fourteen days after the date the direction is served on the last of such persons or, in default of such a nomination, in such name as may be specified in the direction;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_8__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any taxable goods manufactured by one of the constituent members in the course of the activities of the single taxable person shall be treated as being taxable goods manufactured by the single taxable person;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_8__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "each of the constituent members shall be jointly and severally liable for any sales tax payable by the single taxable person;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_8__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "without prejudice to paragraph (c), any failure by the single taxable person to comply with any requirement imposed by or under this Act shall be treated as a failure by each of the constituent members severally; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_8__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "subject to paragraphs (a) to (d), the constituent members shall be treated as a partnership carrying on the business of the single taxable person and any question as to the scope of the activities of that business at any time shall be determined accordingly."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_9",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "9",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where it appears to the Director General that any person who is one of the constituent members should no longer be regarded as such for the purposes of subsections (8)(c) and (d) and the Director General gives notice to that effect, that person shall not have any liability by virtue of those subsections for anything done after the date specified in that notice and accordingly on that date he shall be treated as having ceased to be a member of the partnership referred to in subsection Amendment of section 13A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_6__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_6__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 13A of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_6__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (3), by inserting after the words \"section 17,\" the words \"or 17A,\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_6__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsections: \"(4) Before revoking a licence under subsection (2), the Director General shall serve a notice of revocation of the licence on the person to whom the licence was issued and that licence is revoked with effect from the date as specified in the notice. (5) Before revoking a licence under subsection (3), the Director General shall serve a notice on the person to whom the licence was issued informing him of the proposed revocation and giving him an opportunity to make representation on the matter. (6) Where the Director General is satisfied, after considering the representation of a person made under subsection (5) that the licence of the person should be revoked, he shall serve a notice of revocation of the licence on the person informing him that his licence is revoked from the date specified in the notice.\". New section 1 7A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_7__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_7__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 17 the following section: a ny p r o v i s i on u n d er t h is A ct i n r e l a t i on to an i n v o i c e, a 17A. (1) Subject to subsection (2), for the purposes of taxable person shall be treated as having issued an invoice to a purchaser notwithstanding that there is no delivery of any equivalent document in paper form to the purchaser if the requisite information is recorded in a computer and—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_7__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "is transmitted to the purchaser by electronic means; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_7__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "is produced on any material other than paper and is delivered to the purchaser."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "No provision in relation to computer invoice shall be treated as having been complied with unless the taxable person and the purchaser—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_2__para_a__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_2__para_a__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "have obtained the Director General's approval in writing—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_2__para_a__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_2__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to transmit the document by electronic means, or to produce the document by means of a computer on any material other than paper and to deliver that document; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_2__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_2__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to receive the document through that transmission or delivery, subject to such conditions as he may deem fit to impose; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/6/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "comply with such requirements as may be prescribed by the Director General.\". Amendment of section 23"
      }
    },
